      4 
      <b><span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">ازهد</span></b> , (JK, L,) inf. n. <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">إِزْهَادٌ</span>, (JK, S, L,) <i>He
was,</i> or <i>became, one whose property was not
desired, because of its littleness;</i> (JK, L;) <i>he
possessed little property,</i> (S * L,) <i>which, because
of its littleness, was not desired.</i> (L.) ― 
